content.text:
resetRun calls cockpit.hide/show in main; should update to respect showCockpit. `resetRun`:
```
this.player.cockpit.hide();
this.player.cockpit.show();
```
On touch, show would show it. Need condition. Replace with `if (this.player.showCockpit) this.player.cockpit.show(); else this.player.cockpit.hide();`. Actually before start(), hide/show is unnecessary. Just remove show and keep hide, then start() handles. Change:
```
this.player.cockpit.hide();
```
remove show. Then start shows if allowed. Good.

